  "description": "The simple, best-effort in-memory integration-event (Plane B) bus for Elarion, commit-gated by the EF Core DbContext transaction. A non-durable sibling of the EF Core outbox: buffered per scope, flushed to an in-process delivery pump after commit and discarded on rollback via EF Core interceptors. Events flushed but undelivered at process exit are lost; use the outbox for at-least-once durability.",
